ogress harms everyone by delaying medical breakthroughs and educational tools. Bad actors will always find ways to run open models on personal computers anyway. The real solution is to update our civil laws so victims can sue perpetrators directly for financial damages. Watch for state legislatures passing laws that allow victims to freeze the assets of those who create and share these images.",
